  "title": "Brie and Prosciutto Asparagus Bundles",
  "description": "Bundles of Dijon vinaigrette-marinated asparagus are wrapped in prosciutto and topped with melted Brie in this elegant appetizer or side dish recipe.",
  "authors": [
    "France Cevallos"
  ],
  "date_published": "2018-09-06T23:19:39-04:00",
